can wear as shown in the official illustration or just a normal shirt, etc.\nIf you have an opinion about me, why don't you look at me and talk to me? or something like that, something provocative, something that makes the person proud to be seen.\nPlease consider this.\n\nhttps://wikiwiki.jp/kancolle/Graf%20Zeppelin", "nc": 152, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Kinokonoki1240/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 392644, "client_id": 391731, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0e5ff6bd/uploads/origins/4d67dce4-c40e-46d4-bbe8-2a2ef8dad674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e5d98c28f34a39a9dc141397370e7d5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0e5ff6bd/uploads/origins/4d67dce4-c40e-46d4-bbe8-2a2ef8dad674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e5d98c28f34a39a9dc141397370e7d5, https://si.imgix.net/0e5ff6bd/uploads/origins/4d67dce4-c40e-46d4-bbe8-2a2ef8dad674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=451e80dcd9d1ca26cbd818e2fe62bf94 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0e5ff6bd/uploads/origins/4d67dce4-c40e-46d4-bbe8-2a2ef8dad674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c432765de6e8d5fff22886f8cfcd7eca 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0e5ff6bd/uploads/origins/4d67dce4-c40e-46d4-bbe8-2a2ef8dad674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=01bf28dc6e30406072f95f56a96c7b67", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0e5ff6bd/uploads/origins/4d67dce4-c40e-46d4-bbe8-2a2ef8dad674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=01bf28dc6e30406072f95f56a96c7b67, https://si.imgix.net/0e5ff6bd/uploads/origins/4d67dce4-c40e-46d4-bbe8-2a2ef8dad674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=be3b55f4cf8eafa4a24f95e9caf0a06e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0e5ff6bd/uploads/origins/4d67dce4-c40e-46d4-bbe8-2a2ef8dad674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=21e6d4431c5e0ca161618c0b46a54ef6 3x"}, "body": "Pleased to meet you. I was wondering if you'd like to draw 若宮イヴ from Bandori with the outfit she's wearing in the bottom left of the reference. She can be enjoying the gentle autumn weather.\n\nThe specifics I'll leave up to you.\n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/233658986270949376/1160198956475764819/image.png", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Kinokonoki1240/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 392644, "client_id": 2223302, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b5166297/uploads/origins/aa739606-5111-4e5d-9999-7e27566e70d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cba150dd91cb7950a48f3163d12126c6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b5166297/uploads/origins/aa739606-5111-4e5d-9999-7e27566e70d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cba150dd91cb7950a48f3163d12126c6, https://si.imgix.net/b5166297/uploads/origins/aa739606-5111-4e5d-9999-7e27566e70d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e68fb72c98c8098c783b7dbf62f58615 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b5166297/uploads/origins/aa739606-5111-4e5d-9999-7e27566e70d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9791779633a1e29fbf7d9ae3bd9d66d8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b5166297/uploads/origins/aa739606-5111-4e5d-9999-7e27566e70d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cfbdb835b2f78763d9dc633773dd3d39", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b5166297/uploads/origins/aa739606-5111-4e5d-9999-7e27566e70d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cfbdb835b2f78763d9dc633773dd3d39, https://si.imgix.net/b5166297/uploads/origins/aa739606-5111-4e5d-9999-7e27566e70d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6db706624ddb976e70fc65f52dc04b2b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b5166297/uploads/origins/aa739606-5111-4e5d-9999-7e27566e70d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=31da5deffcb3b5df9867bdc4cd7ae177 3x"}, "body": "Good evening from the Appeal.\nI'm not sure what you mean by \"Shioribe\" (or \"Shiori-mi\"), but here is the image I generated for it\n\nShiori-ba.\n\nHair and Eyes: Yutani Reika's hair is burgundy, long and beautiful, a vibrant color that evokes the power of magic. Her eyes are a deep green, hiding secrets of knowledge and magic.\n\nClothing: Yutani Linghua wears a magical costume that symbolizes her role as a Potions Master. Her costume is in shades of crimson and emerald green, embroidered with ghost motifs and alchemical symbols. Around her waist is a belt that holds bottles of magic potions and materials.\n\nAccessories: Yugoku Reika wears a magical pendant around her neck, which is also the source of her magical powers. Also, a ring with a ghost motif shines on her finger. These accessories amplify and protect her magical powers.\n\nMagical Apothecary Tools: As a magical apothecary, Yugoku Reika has a book and a huge magic bottle. The table is lined with test tubes and herbs, and her magic potion concoctions are in progress.\n\nPose: Reika Yutani is concentrating on her magical concoction, her hands certainly operating as she pours the liquid from the test tubes. Her face is filled with knowledge and joy for the power of magic.\n\nBACKGROUND: Behind her, a magical library and shelves stacked with books of magic, an ocean of knowledge and a world of magic.\n\n\n\nBest regards.", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Kinokonoki1240/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 392644, "client_id": 345289, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c3e94cab/uploads/origins/c34cb921-4e7d-453c-bc19-2c09d884cb91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd18884dba0729b69222976db5ba75bc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c3e94cab/uploads/origins/c34cb921-4e7d-453c-bc19-2c09d884cb91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd18884dba0729b69222976db5ba75bc, https://si.imgix.net/c3e94cab/uploads/origins/c34cb921-4e7d-453c-bc19-2c09d884cb91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=35c746be69600f2928743144e0910e2e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c3e94cab/uploads/origins/c34cb921-4e7d-453c-bc19-2c09d884cb91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c85e2e36ce5894bf65ce93a90f72f61 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c3e94cab/uploads/origins/c34cb921-4e7d-453c-bc19-2c09d884cb91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=df407c5529663d9e0b7900a9ffb4adfc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c3e94cab/uploads/origins/c34cb921-4e7d-453c-bc19-2c09d884cb91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=df407c5529663d9e0b7900a9ffb4adfc, https://si.imgix.net/c3e94cab/uploads/origins/c34cb921-4e7d-453c-bc19-2c09d884cb91?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e3333d5a6996afc9c8e952d5255a969d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c3e94cab/u